  "description": "Calculate the maximum wealth among all customers, where each customer's wealth is the sum of money in their bank accounts.",
  "target": 10,
  "pseudocode": "let maxWealth = 0;\nfor (let i = 0; i < accounts.length; i++) {\n  let currentWealth = 0;\n  for (let j = 0; j < accounts[i].length; j++) {\n    currentWealth += accounts[i][j];\n  }\n  maxWealth = Math.max(maxWealth, currentWealth);\n}\nreturn maxWealth;",
